; === Custom Hotkeys ===

; Remap Ctrl + 2 to F2
^2::F2

; Remap Ctrl + 5 to F5
^5::F5

; Remap Ctrl + Shft + 5 to F5
^+5::+F5

; Remap Ctrl + 6 to F6
^6::F6

; Remap Ctrl + 8 to F10
^8::F10

; Remap Ctrl + 9 to F11
^9::F11

; Remap Ctrl + 0 to F12
^0::F12

; Remap Ctrl + Left Click to Right Click
^LButton::Click('Right')

